{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The freezers are stocked, and the scoops are ready. You and your friends are set to become the ultimate ice cream dream team, make colorful flavors, and keep customers cool and happy! Let your dreams come true, one scoop at a time!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/cc751893758b2bd825571edc2e820021.avif?t=1773772691\" width=675 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/ea329f19cf57419ab46966a7df45ed26.poster.avif?t=1773772691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/ea329f19cf57419ab46966a7df45ed26.webm?t=1773772691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/ea329f19cf57419ab46966a7df45ed26.mp4?t=1773772691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start by making your base mix in the pasteurizer, then toss in tasty ingredients to whip up custom flavors in the ice cream machine. You decide what's served.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/701cb58f5299e81edea2eaaca5cae301.avif?t=1773772691\" width=675 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/9e276a66f1eb9b80af492d4802a85607.poster.avif?t=1773772691\" width=664 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/9e276a66f1eb9b80af492d4802a85607.webm?t=1773772691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/9e276a66f1eb9b80af492d4802a85607.mp4?t=1773772691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock, upgrade, and purchase a variety of different furniture, machines, and decorations. Place them around your parlor. It's your style, your rules!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/37f53a4a1e56ff44388a687ab6eaa4f4.avif?t=1773772691\" width=675 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/45f79895ffd5cd1f9303c31d5c7be73b.poster.avif?t=1773772691\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/45f79895ffd5cd1f9303c31d5c7be73b.webm?t=1773772691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/45f79895ffd5cd1f9303c31d5c7be73b.mp4?t=1773772691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 player online co-op lets you scoop solo or work in a team. Coordinate with friends to keep the shop running smoothly, split tasks for max efficiency, or let your profits melt away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/533ecb50e0066b016584bfdcfb9df5bb.poster.avif?t=1773772691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445110/extras/533ecb50e0066b016584bfdcfb9df5bb.webm?t=1773772691\" type